# Model weights, converted tensor packages, and array dumps are operator-local.
# Contracts and aggregate hashes may be committed; the payloads may not.
*.[nN][eE][mM][oO]
*.[pP][tT]
*.[pP][tT][hH]
*.[cC][kK][pP][tT]
*.[sS][aA][fF][eE][tT][eE][nN][sS][oO][rR][sS]
*.[oO][nN][nN][xX]
*.[nN][pP][yY]
*.[nN][pP][zZ]
*.[nN][eE][mM][oO]
*.[sS][aA][fF][eE][tT][eE][nN][sS][oO][rR][sS]
*.[gG][gG][uU][fF]
*.[gG][gG][mM][lL]
[gG][gG][mM][lL]-*.[bB][iI][nN]
[pP][yY][tT][oO][rR][cC][hH]_[mM][oO][dD][eE][lL]*.[bB][iI][nN]
*[aA][cC][tT][iI][vV][aA][tT][iI][oO][nN]-[rR][eE][cC][eE][iI][pP][tT]*.[jJ][sS][oO][nN]
*[aA][cC][tT][iI][vV][aA][tT][iI][oO][nN]_[rR][eE][cC][eE][iI][pP][tT]*.[jJ][sS][oO][nN]
*[cC][oO][nN][vV][eE][rR][sS][iI][oO][nN]-[rR][eE][cC][eE][iI][pP][tT]*.[jJ][sS][oO][nN]
*[cC][oO][nN][vV][eE][rR][sS][iI][oO][nN]_[rR][eE][cC][eE][iI][pP][tT]*.[jJ][sS][oO][nN]

